OL,3,GNEWSA'Being a young worker helps me in
OL,4,Aso many ways'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old has said being a younger
OL,7,Fworker has helped build her confidence
OL,8,Fas well as her social and time
OL,9,Fmanagement skills.
OL,11,FJessica Marshall, from the Grapevine
OL,12,FBar in Herne Bay in Kent, said many of
OL,13,Fher friends hadn't managed to find a
OL,14,Fjob so struggled to "talk to anyone and
OL,15,Feveryone".
OL,17,F"Confidence, being able to talk to
OL,18,Fpeople, managing time, being reliable,
OL,19,Fit helps in so many ways," she said.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
